WEBVTT

02:42.880 --> 02:44.760
So, you like to use this side
of the lipstick.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.160
Su Miao's notes.

03:31.440 --> 03:33.080
I haven't seen her handwriting before.

04:01.080 --> 04:02.600
I heard you were sick,

04:02.680 --> 04:03.720
so I came here to visit you.

04:04.880 --> 04:05.720
Thanks.

04:06.880 --> 04:08.360
I don't eat puffed snacks.

04:08.440 --> 04:09.480
Share them with your colleagues.

04:12.800 --> 04:14.240
Are you not going to invite me in?

04:15.400 --> 04:16.240
No.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.600
I'm already here.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.760
Aren't you bored alone?
I can chat with you.

04:25.400 --> 04:26.520
It's working time.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.440
I hope you can go back to work.

04:33.920 --> 04:36.120
I want to get back to work,

04:36.200 --> 04:38.400
but how can I not worry about you?

05:01.280 --> 05:02.360
Su Chengcheng…

05:24.840 --> 05:25.840
This…

05:32.680 --> 05:33.800
Gu Yu asked me

05:33.880 --> 05:35.160
if I can give Su Miao's stuff

05:35.240 --> 05:36.600
to you as a souvenir,

05:36.680 --> 05:38.320
so I sent the pet she's raised
since childhood

05:38.400 --> 05:39.760
to you.

05:39.840 --> 05:41.200
Please treat it well.

05:41.280 --> 05:43.080
Remember, don't touch it.

05:43.160 --> 05:44.280
It doesn't like that.

05:45.040 --> 05:46.240
Hello. Hello?

05:58.080 --> 05:59.800
Su Miao raised you?

06:11.200 --> 06:14.280
You're as stubborn as her.

06:16.720 --> 06:17.960
Come in.

06:18.040 --> 06:20.240
From now on, this is your new home.

06:54.080 --> 06:55.280
It's said

06:56.440 --> 06:58.080
alpaca likes coldness and hates heat.

07:00.000 --> 07:01.800
Is it more comfortable now?

07:08.800 --> 07:10.200
Idiot!

07:12.360 --> 07:14.160
You do look better.

07:15.360 --> 07:16.560
You're blind!

07:18.280 --> 07:20.000
It seems you really like coldness.

07:20.080 --> 07:22.040
You even want to sleep, right?

07:40.400 --> 07:43.200
Tang Qi will torture me to death!

08:47.520 --> 08:49.040
STARLIGHT EYESHADOW SHOOTING PROCESS

08:50.600 --> 08:51.760
It's really here.

09:47.600 --> 09:50.800
It's an alpaca, not an ape.

09:51.400 --> 09:55.000
It's an alpaca, not an ape.

09:59.200 --> 10:01.440
Illusion, illusion.

10:01.520 --> 10:04.440
I should've turned into an ape.

10:04.520 --> 10:05.520
Illusion.

10:32.960 --> 10:35.680
Do you know this is the only
handwriting Su Miao left me?

10:36.880 --> 10:38.640
I know.

10:38.720 --> 10:40.720
That's why I must destroy it.

10:47.920 --> 10:49.160
You know nothing.

10:50.520 --> 10:52.040
What's the point of being mad at you?

10:55.200 --> 10:56.760
What's the point?

10:56.840 --> 10:59.320
There are many files
with my handwriting in the office.

10:59.400 --> 11:01.560
You can take as many as you want.

11:02.960 --> 11:04.760
AFTERNOON: MAKEUP AND DRESSING

11:06.680 --> 11:08.440
It's okay, I can fix it.

11:14.000 --> 11:14.880
Look.

11:51.960 --> 11:53.960
Tang Qi is pissed off and wants to hit me.

12:02.640 --> 12:04.280
You're destroying things

12:05.520 --> 12:07.160
because you can't see your master

12:08.280 --> 12:09.200
and are upset, right?

12:15.080 --> 12:18.480
I'm also sad and upset.

12:21.240 --> 12:22.640
She was such a nice person.

12:26.920 --> 12:28.720
Yet she left at such a young age.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.040
Stay here. Don't move.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.280
I'll get the vacuum cleaner.

13:51.960 --> 13:53.000
No!

14:07.200 --> 14:08.680
Look what you've done!

15:23.240 --> 15:24.520
If I fight back,

15:25.400 --> 15:28.200
will the news say
that an alpaca bullied a human?

15:41.280 --> 15:42.120
Here.

15:42.640 --> 15:43.800
Eat it.

15:45.600 --> 15:47.760
You're also upset,

15:47.840 --> 15:48.720
so I forgive you.

15:49.720 --> 15:51.360
However, if you do this again,

15:51.960 --> 15:53.000
I won't give you carrots.

15:54.640 --> 15:55.480
Just eat.

16:04.280 --> 16:05.560
Are you sick?

16:06.400 --> 16:08.040
Do you need to see a vet?

16:09.160 --> 16:11.240
You need to see a vet.

16:20.280 --> 16:21.360
Good.

16:23.920 --> 16:25.040
There's more.

16:27.360 --> 16:30.480
Good thing that I turned
into a grazing animal

16:30.560 --> 16:32.800
that doesn't eat raw meat.

16:51.120 --> 16:53.880
Why are you suddenly asking
about how to comfort an alpaca?

16:53.960 --> 16:55.760
I remember your mom owns a pet store,

16:56.280 --> 16:58.680
and you happen to be a volunteer
at Animal Association.

16:59.760 --> 17:02.840
Maybe you know

17:02.920 --> 17:04.680
how to make an angry alpaca calm down.

17:05.240 --> 17:06.599
I do have experience.

17:06.680 --> 17:09.319
I saved and took care
of an abandoned alpaca.

17:09.400 --> 17:10.240
Why are you asking this?

17:12.359 --> 17:13.720
I raised an alpaca.

17:14.400 --> 17:15.680
But it's in a bad mood,

17:17.079 --> 17:18.200
destroying my things.

17:18.839 --> 17:20.160
You raised an alpaca?

17:20.920 --> 17:22.880
- When did it happen?
- Two hours ago.

17:22.960 --> 17:24.480
It was Su Miao's pet.

17:25.599 --> 17:26.560
Lin Yuan sent it to me.

17:27.160 --> 17:28.280
Alpaca looks gentle

17:28.359 --> 17:29.440
but is highly destructive.

17:30.280 --> 17:31.400
Your eyes are not well.

17:31.480 --> 17:32.840
You should keep your distance.

17:32.920 --> 17:34.080
But I'm still worried about it.

17:34.680 --> 17:36.800
I can feel it's kind in nature.

17:37.440 --> 17:39.000
It's destroying things for a reason.

17:40.000 --> 17:40.840
I should come over.

17:41.760 --> 17:43.040
That's for the best.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.840
Gu Yu is coming.

17:55.920 --> 17:57.640
He used to be a volunteer
for animal protection.

17:57.720 --> 17:58.640
He might find out.

18:33.520 --> 18:34.560
I like you.

18:39.120 --> 18:40.600
I will take care of you.

18:42.600 --> 18:44.080
I'll feed you the finest food

18:49.320 --> 18:50.760
and prepare a low-temperature room.

19:06.440 --> 19:07.960
Lin Yuan, help!

19:09.280 --> 19:12.160
Don't worry, I'm good
at drawing crisis scenes.

19:18.520 --> 19:20.400
It's under construction. No entry!

19:33.840 --> 19:35.120
Wait.

19:46.800 --> 19:49.240
- Do you need an ambulance?
- No.

19:52.320 --> 19:55.480
Indeed. There are two cameras,

19:55.560 --> 19:57.160
and I have a driving recorder.

19:57.240 --> 19:58.640
No blind spot.

19:58.720 --> 20:00.280
If not an ambulance,

20:00.360 --> 20:01.800
I should call the police.

20:04.040 --> 20:04.880
That's right.

20:08.920 --> 20:10.680
What a coincidence!

20:11.760 --> 20:12.800
Are you okay?

20:12.880 --> 20:14.720
I thought you were a scammer

20:14.800 --> 20:16.120
who played a stupid trick.

20:18.360 --> 20:20.240
It's really under construction.

20:20.320 --> 20:22.040
It was just finished.

20:22.920 --> 20:24.840
I'm unlucky whenever I meet you.

20:24.920 --> 20:26.320
I must've twisted my ankle.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.840
Can you take me home?

20:28.960 --> 20:30.400
Let me help you.

20:35.920 --> 20:36.840
That's the right foot.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.480
Didn't you hurt the left one?

20:39.280 --> 20:41.120
It doesn't matter.

20:41.200 --> 20:43.280
What matters is that it really hurts.

20:43.360 --> 20:46.120
I really twisted my ankle!
I'm not pretending!

20:46.200 --> 20:47.160
Okay, not pretending.

20:47.240 --> 20:48.840
I know it's real.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.040
Come on.

21:02.240 --> 21:03.640
Hello, Tang. How is it going?

21:04.880 --> 21:07.920
I have an emergency.

21:08.520 --> 21:09.960
Maybe I'll be late,

21:10.040 --> 21:12.320
by one or two hours.

21:12.400 --> 21:14.280
DEAR CHENG: I STOPPED GU YU. ESCAPE NOW!

21:53.440 --> 21:54.360
You…

21:56.880 --> 21:58.680
You know how to open the door?

22:00.320 --> 22:01.560
You're so smart.

22:02.320 --> 22:04.720
I can't even compare to an alpaca.

22:04.800 --> 22:06.440
I've been working hard,

22:06.520 --> 22:07.720
but you've never praised me.

22:07.800 --> 22:09.320
Are you bored?

22:10.080 --> 22:11.960
Let's go to the study. I'll play with you.

22:21.720 --> 22:22.840
You don't like it?

22:24.120 --> 22:24.960
Do you want cabbage?

22:26.080 --> 22:29.160
I also have water spinach,
romaine lettuce, and broccoli.

22:31.200 --> 22:32.560
Are you threatening me?

22:41.880 --> 22:43.280
You're really smart.

22:43.880 --> 22:45.520
I think you even understand my words.

22:47.560 --> 22:49.160
Stupid human.

23:08.120 --> 23:09.840
This is when Su Miao was sick.

23:11.800 --> 23:12.720
Isn't she cute?

23:14.080 --> 23:17.560
Su Miao rejected me on that day.

23:18.760 --> 23:20.920
If you knew who I was,

23:21.000 --> 23:23.160
you'd thank me for rejecting you.

23:40.080 --> 23:41.240
It turns out

23:41.320 --> 23:44.280
it's an applicant's resume.

23:44.360 --> 23:47.040
No wonder no colleagues
look like the owner of the book.

23:51.600 --> 23:52.680
This.

23:52.760 --> 23:53.960
This is a bag.

23:55.920 --> 23:57.640
We use it to keep things.

23:59.360 --> 24:00.920
It's Tang Qi!

24:19.320 --> 24:20.560
You recognize her?

24:22.040 --> 24:24.640
She doesn't have a face.
Who can recognize that?

24:28.000 --> 24:30.240
This is when we first met.

24:31.240 --> 24:34.760
When I came out of the cafe,

24:35.800 --> 24:38.080
I saw Su Miao

24:38.160 --> 24:41.600
risking her life to save a kid.

24:43.000 --> 24:44.040
At that moment,

24:46.960 --> 24:48.720
I thought I saw an angel.

25:11.960 --> 25:12.800
That day…

25:14.480 --> 25:16.640
I didn't even see her face.

25:18.080 --> 25:20.160
I didn't know what she looked like,

25:21.400 --> 25:23.320
yet my heart was racing.

25:25.160 --> 25:29.240
For the first time,
I understood love at first sight.

25:33.480 --> 25:34.920
I didn't know one's heartbeats

25:36.800 --> 25:38.320
could be so loud.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.800
Su Miao got injured.

25:52.320 --> 25:54.440
She even got a scratch on her face,

25:55.800 --> 25:57.040
but she didn't care.

25:58.200 --> 26:00.120
She was comforting the frightened child.

26:01.200 --> 26:04.360
She didn't take it out
on the driver who almost hit a child.

26:04.960 --> 26:06.480
In your eyes,

26:07.320 --> 26:08.880
no matter what we look like,

26:09.480 --> 26:11.080
we're all ugly hairless creatures.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.840
But I'm sure Su Miao is the prettiest.

26:16.080 --> 26:17.720
Did I get him wrong?

26:18.680 --> 26:21.400
He didn't fall in love with her
because of her face?

26:25.080 --> 26:25.960
Impossible.

26:26.040 --> 26:28.440
He only cares about appearance.
How could he ignore her face?

26:30.520 --> 26:31.600
Use the ice bag.

26:32.960 --> 26:34.920
Rest well. I have to go.

26:46.960 --> 26:48.840
I'm alone!

26:48.920 --> 26:51.960
My parents divorced
and remarried when I was little.

26:52.040 --> 26:53.160
I live alone.

26:54.040 --> 26:56.360
Can you wash some fruit for me?

26:59.560 --> 27:01.440
Fruit? Over there.

27:04.200 --> 27:05.680
I want the fruit in the fridge.

27:06.880 --> 27:08.040
Okay.

27:08.120 --> 27:11.200
Can you get off me first

27:11.280 --> 27:12.880
so that I can wash them?

27:13.480 --> 27:14.320
Wait a minute.

27:15.200 --> 27:16.760
I want all kinds of fruit.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.600
- Okay.
- Wash them carefully.

27:23.400 --> 27:26.040
DEAR CHENG: HOW'S IT GOING?

27:26.120 --> 27:28.880
HAVE MEDICINE

27:52.640 --> 27:54.640
Tang Qi's eyes are not well.

27:55.240 --> 27:56.680
I'm a tetrachromat.

27:59.120 --> 28:00.360
Tetrachromat.

28:08.560 --> 28:09.920
Normally,

28:11.160 --> 28:13.440
humans have three types of cone cells,

28:13.520 --> 28:15.560
which makes them trichromats.

28:16.800 --> 28:18.840
Most colorblind people

28:18.920 --> 28:20.880
have only two types of cone cells,

28:20.960 --> 28:22.520
so they are dichromats.

28:22.600 --> 28:25.840
However, tetrachromats
have four types of cone cells.

28:26.440 --> 28:28.240
Every type can distinguish

28:28.320 --> 28:29.800
about a hundred shades of a color.

28:30.400 --> 28:32.120
With more types of cone cells,

28:32.200 --> 28:33.840
the number of the colors
one can distinguish

28:33.920 --> 28:35.360
will multiply.

28:36.200 --> 28:38.920
Therefore, tetrachromats
can see a hundred times

28:39.600 --> 28:41.880
more colors than others do.

28:43.320 --> 28:46.320
So, the world you see

28:46.920 --> 28:48.320
is completely different.

28:54.840 --> 28:56.480
My eyes have been sensitive
since childhood.

28:57.760 --> 28:59.240
I can't stand strong lights.

29:07.400 --> 29:09.240
That's why

29:09.320 --> 29:11.320
he hates fluorescent

29:11.880 --> 29:13.240
and glittering things.

29:43.760 --> 29:44.960
An alpaca can walk upright

29:47.000 --> 29:48.560
through training.

29:56.800 --> 29:58.400
It was at noon,

29:58.480 --> 30:00.120
and the sun was the brightest.

30:10.120 --> 30:11.920
He really couldn't see my face.

30:12.000 --> 30:12.840
I got him wrong.

30:18.400 --> 30:19.840
No wonder he suddenly passed out.

30:21.520 --> 30:24.760
An alpaca can walk upright
through training.

30:24.840 --> 30:26.520
An alpaca can walk upright
through training…

30:51.040 --> 30:51.920
Sorry.

30:52.680 --> 30:54.720
I didn't know you were a tetrachromat

30:54.800 --> 30:55.960
who's sensitive to lights.

30:59.080 --> 31:00.080
Are you worried about me?

31:01.480 --> 31:03.360
My eyes are fine.

31:04.840 --> 31:06.840
I just have an extra type of cone cells

31:07.440 --> 31:09.440
and happen to be sensitive to lights.

31:10.680 --> 31:12.440
I just need to be more careful.

31:13.080 --> 31:14.400
It won't affect my daily life.

31:15.800 --> 31:17.440
If I use it properly,

31:18.080 --> 31:19.600
it will be useful for my work.

31:21.200 --> 31:22.520
From another view,

31:23.120 --> 31:27.400
you could say I have superhuman vision.

31:29.840 --> 31:30.680
Sorry.

31:43.920 --> 31:47.120
Alright. I'm sleepy
after taking the medicine.

31:47.640 --> 31:49.440
I'll get some rest.

31:49.520 --> 31:50.640
Let's play later,

31:50.720 --> 31:51.560
okay?

32:01.360 --> 32:03.720
Why do you still look upset?

32:06.160 --> 32:08.320
Look, I have this.

32:12.280 --> 32:13.120
Look.

32:19.320 --> 32:21.160
This is the hair tie Su Miao once used.

32:23.080 --> 32:25.440
She got drunk and left it in my house.

32:28.160 --> 32:29.560
I wanted to give it back.

32:32.680 --> 32:34.320
But I didn't get a chance.

32:42.520 --> 32:43.760
Now I can't give it back.

32:49.000 --> 32:50.040
I'm glad I didn't do it.

32:54.840 --> 32:58.440
You can recognize this hair tie, right?

33:00.560 --> 33:04.880
You're here with me when I'm sad

33:07.800 --> 33:08.840
and desperate.

33:12.640 --> 33:13.760
I feel much better.

33:16.280 --> 33:17.120
Thanks.

33:33.080 --> 33:34.920
Even the turtle finished the game.

33:35.000 --> 33:37.200
Why are you still trapped there?

33:39.920 --> 33:41.720
All kinds of fruit.

33:42.640 --> 33:44.800
If nothing else, I'll go back.

33:46.480 --> 33:47.920
There is!

33:48.800 --> 33:51.520
I didn't eat much during lunch.

33:51.600 --> 33:54.240
I'm super hungry right now.

33:55.400 --> 33:57.640
Can you make some noodles for me?

33:59.280 --> 34:00.280
Okay.

34:00.360 --> 34:03.000
A fried egg and some vegetables.

34:03.080 --> 34:05.200
It's good for my recovery.

34:06.280 --> 34:07.440
Okay, wait a minute.

34:09.120 --> 34:10.199
Thank you.

34:15.800 --> 34:17.280
DEAR CHENG

34:24.920 --> 34:26.159
Scamming,

34:28.639 --> 34:30.239
pretending it was real,

34:31.679 --> 34:33.080
telling sad family stories,

34:34.440 --> 34:35.880
and playing dumb…

34:36.920 --> 34:39.040
I've used all the tricks.

34:42.760 --> 34:43.679
There's only one left.

34:53.199 --> 34:55.080
But it's for the vicious
female supporting role.

34:55.159 --> 34:56.400
It's doomed to failure.

35:22.840 --> 35:23.840
Tang Qi?

35:24.360 --> 35:25.320
Tang Qi?

36:34.320 --> 36:36.640
DEAR CHENG: CRISIS OVER. I'M COMING

36:40.080 --> 36:41.480
You can stop! I'm not hungry.

36:43.760 --> 36:44.600
It's done?

36:48.040 --> 36:50.480
You're impressive. That's so fast.

36:51.760 --> 36:54.240
Sorry for the trouble.

36:55.120 --> 36:56.120
I'm returning your favor.

36:56.200 --> 36:58.120
When I got drunk,
I also caused trouble for you.

36:58.880 --> 37:01.000
I shouldn't have taken the money.

37:10.200 --> 37:11.040
Hello.

37:14.800 --> 37:15.920
Okay.

37:19.520 --> 37:20.520
Is everything okay?

37:21.720 --> 37:23.120
A friend borrowed my money

37:23.200 --> 37:24.240
and disappeared,

37:24.320 --> 37:26.520
but he just said he'd pay me back.

37:27.760 --> 37:28.440
RECEIVE

37:28.520 --> 37:29.720
He really did.

37:29.800 --> 37:30.880
Congratulations.

37:31.760 --> 37:33.680
It's a good day, isn't it?

37:35.240 --> 37:36.840
My friend needs me. I have to go.

37:40.040 --> 37:41.160
Nothing else?

37:41.240 --> 37:42.120
No.

37:42.720 --> 37:43.600
- Okay.
- Thanks.

37:46.440 --> 37:47.640
Bye.

38:43.800 --> 38:45.480
When I came here, you were asleep.

38:45.560 --> 38:46.560
I didn't wake you up.

38:49.800 --> 38:51.800
I can't believe I slept for half a day.

38:56.760 --> 38:58.680
You hadn't rested well,
so you needed sleep.

38:58.760 --> 39:00.080
How are you feeling?

39:01.080 --> 39:02.640
I'm not tired anymore.

39:03.520 --> 39:04.840
And my eyes have recovered.

39:07.520 --> 39:09.040
Did you take me to my bedroom?

39:10.120 --> 39:12.040
You were there when I arrived.

39:12.120 --> 39:14.880
Maybe you subconsciously
went there after taking the medicine.

39:21.200 --> 39:22.240
Where's the alpaca?

39:23.000 --> 39:24.160
Did it eat?

39:25.120 --> 39:27.240
I searched the entire house
but didn't see it.

39:27.320 --> 39:28.640
Impossible.

39:28.720 --> 39:30.840
When I fell asleep, it was by my side.

39:56.160 --> 39:58.160
Did it open the door and run?

40:00.600 --> 40:02.760
It's Lin Yuan.
Maybe it's about the alpaca.

40:03.520 --> 40:04.360
Hello.

40:06.520 --> 40:08.440
Yes, the alpaca ran away.

40:10.320 --> 40:11.160
What?

40:12.600 --> 40:14.320
Su Chengcheng found it?

40:16.320 --> 40:17.920
Then, where is it?

40:19.800 --> 40:22.200
No, I need to see it now.

40:24.480 --> 40:26.280
Su Miao told us

40:26.360 --> 40:29.120
she wanted to send it to the zoo

40:29.200 --> 40:31.360
so that it can get professional care

40:31.440 --> 40:33.400
and make some friends to avoid loneliness.

40:33.480 --> 40:35.680
Lin Yuan didn't make it clear.

40:35.760 --> 40:37.800
She only lent it to you for a day.

40:46.240 --> 40:47.440
Not this one.

40:50.080 --> 40:52.360
I transformed according to its appearance.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.360
It's exactly the same.

40:57.840 --> 40:58.680
It is this one.

40:59.880 --> 41:00.840
Exactly the same.

41:06.040 --> 41:07.560
That's right. It's this one.

41:10.840 --> 41:12.680
My alpaca is picky about food.

41:13.960 --> 41:15.680
And it looks at me sincerely,

41:17.240 --> 41:18.920
as if it can understand me.

41:21.040 --> 41:22.240
It's not…

41:25.480 --> 41:26.640
this one.

41:30.760 --> 41:31.800
Perhaps

41:31.880 --> 41:34.600
the alpaca acted differently

41:34.680 --> 41:35.800
in a strange place yesterday,

41:35.880 --> 41:36.840
and you got it wrong.

41:37.360 --> 41:38.760
This is how it is.

41:41.600 --> 41:42.760
It's completely different.

41:44.360 --> 41:45.560
Don't worry.

41:45.640 --> 41:47.600
The breeder is our friend

41:47.680 --> 41:49.160
and will take good care of it.

41:49.760 --> 41:51.320
It has many friends

41:51.400 --> 41:52.680
and bigger space.

41:52.760 --> 41:54.800
It's much better
than being kept in a house.

42:03.080 --> 42:03.920
No matter what,

42:04.640 --> 42:06.000
thank you for bringing me here.

42:07.960 --> 42:08.800
My pleasure.
